{"seq":1,"slug":"long-short-transit-fee-fx","title":"长款/短款/在途/手续费/汇率差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-classify-match/long-short-transit-fee-fx","wordCount":2474,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"长款-短款-在途-手续费-汇率差异\">长款/短款/在途/手续费/汇率差异</h1><p>一笔跨境订单在平台账本上记 <code>+100.00 USD</code>，在支付渠道的结算文件里出现 <code>-97.80 USD</code>。差额 2.20 美元可能来自三十多种原因，而其中只有一种是&quot;真的错了&quot;。如果系统把手续费当短款处理，就会给渠道运营团队生成一张毫无意义的追款工单；如果系统把在途差异当短款处理，就会在次日自动消失的差异上浪费一整天人力。分类因此不是标注问题，而是成本问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-五类差异与它们的财务含义\">核心概念：五类差异与它们的财务含义</h2><p>差异分类的第一原则是：<strong>先分方向，再分成因</strong>。方向决定这笔差异在账上是资产还是负债（是否真的欠对方钱），成因决定它该走哪条处置路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;不平明细&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;金额方向？&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;我方账 &gt; 对方账&quot;| C[&quot;长款&lt;br/&gt;overage&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;我方账 &lt; 对方账&quot;| D[&quot;短款&lt;br/&gt;shortage&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E{&quot;是否为时间差？&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| F[&quot;在途&lt;br/&gt;in-transit / timing&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| G{&quot;是否可归因于扣费？&quot;}&#10;  G --&gt;|&quot;渠道扣费&quot;| H[&quot;手续费差异&lt;br/&gt;fee difference&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|&quot;换汇折算&quot;| I[&quot;汇率差异&lt;br/&gt;FX difference&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|&quot;都不是&quot;| J[&quot;未明差异&lt;br/&gt;转人工调查&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"不平明细\"] --&gt; B{\"金额方向？\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"我方账 &gt; 对方账\"| C[\"长款&lt;br/&gt;overage\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"我方账 &lt; 对方账\"| D[\"短款&lt;br/&gt;shortage\"]\n  C --&gt; E{\"是否为时间差？\"}\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt;|\"是\"| F[\"在途&lt;br/&gt;in-transit / timing\"]\n  E --&gt;|\"否\"| G{\"是否可归因于扣费？\"}\n  G --&gt;|\"渠道扣费\"| H[\"手续费差异&lt;br/&gt;fee difference\"]\n  G --&gt;|\"换汇折算\"| I[\"汇率差异&lt;br/&gt;FX difference\"]\n  G --&gt;|\"都不是\"| J[\"未明差异&lt;br/&gt;转人工调查\"]</pre><p>五类差异的对照表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>典型成因</th>\n<th>是否真差异</th>\n<th>次日是否自动消失</th>\n<th>首选手工处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>长款（overage）</td>\n<td>渠道重复入账、退款未落地、优惠未冲回</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>转应收/暂收，追查后核销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短款（shortage）</td>\n<td>渠道漏结算、我方漏记账、预扣未冲回</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>转应收，向渠道发起查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在途（in-transit）</td>\n<td>清算时点差异、跨日切分、跨时区</td>\n<td>否（多数）</td>\n<td>是（通常 T+1~T+3）</td>\n<td>设观察窗，到期未消才升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手续费差异</td>\n<td>渠道费率调整未同步、阶梯费率、跨境附加费</td>\n<td>是（小额）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>容差内核销，超差查费率表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率差异</td>\n<td>换汇点差、折算时点不同、报价源不同</td>\n<td>是（小额）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>按容差核销，差异率异常则查报价源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>记住这张表里最重要的一列：<strong>&quot;次日是否自动消失&quot;</strong>。在途差异如果不设观察窗就直接建工单，人工工单量会被时间差淹没——这是新系统最常见的第一个坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长款与短款-方向决定处置路径\">长款与短款：方向决定处置路径</h2><h3 id=\"以平台账本为基准的差值约定\">以平台账本为基准的差值约定</h3><p>长短款的判断依赖于一个&quot;基准方向&quot;约定。跨境场景里最稳妥的约定是：<strong>以平台账本为基准，渠道结算文件为对手方</strong>，差值为正即长款，为负即短款。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>diff</mtext><mtext>raw</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>amount</mtext><mtext>ledger</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>amount</mtext><mtext>channel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{diff}_{\\text{raw}} = \\text{amount}_{\\text{ledger}} - \\text{amount}_{\\text{channel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diff</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">raw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ledger</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个约定必须在系统边界处固化成一个字段，而不是在每段业务代码里各自解释。一旦某个渠道的适配器偷偷改用&quot;渠道为基准&quot;，同一批数据会在不同模块里得到相反的长短款结论，而错误只在最下游的账务模块才暴露。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归一化陷阱与不变量约束\">归一化陷阱与不变量约束</h3><p>方向必须与币种符号解耦。有些渠道文件用带符号的金额（退款为负），有些用独立的 CRDT/DBIT 标识位（ISO 20022 的 camt 系列正是后者——见 <a href=\"exception-match-suggest\">差异自动匹配建议</a>），还有些用正数 + 类型码。归一化时若把标识位漏读，整批差异符号反转，长款会全变短款。</p>\n<p>第二个陷阱是轧差。长短款要分别挂在不同的暂记科目，不能轧差成一条：长款是我方多拿的钱，有潜在返还义务；短款是我方少拿的钱，有追索权利，两者在法律与账务上地位不同。轧差会同时丢失追索权和返还义务，月末无法向审计解释。</p>\n<p>一条可直接落地的差异分类 DDL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE recon_exception (&#10;  exception_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  batch_id         BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  channel_code     TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  currency         CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  diff_type        TEXT        NOT NULL CHECK (diff_type IN&#10;                     (&#39;overage&#39;,&#39;shortage&#39;,&#39;in_transit&#39;,&#39;fee_diff&#39;,&#39;fx_diff&#39;,&#39;unknown&#39;)),&#10;  diff_direction   SMALLINT    NOT NULL CHECK (diff_direction IN (1,-1)),&#10;  ledger_amount    NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  channel_amount   NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  diff_amount      NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  value_date       DATE        NOT NULL,&#10;  detected_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  classify_confidence NUMERIC(4,3),&#10;  status           TEXT        NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;open&#39;&#10;                     CHECK (status IN (&#39;open&#39;,&#39;routed&#39;,&#39;suspended&#39;,&#39;closed&#39;)),&#10;  CONSTRAINT diff_amount_consistent&#10;    CHECK (diff_amount = ledger_amount - channel_amount)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON recon_exception (channel_code, value_date, diff_type)&#10;  WHERE status &lt;&gt; &#39;closed&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recon_exception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exception_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  batch_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diff_type        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (diff_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                     (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'overage'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shortage'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_transit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fee_diff'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fx_diff'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diff_direction   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (diff_direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ledger_amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_amount   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diff_amount      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  value_date       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detected_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  classify_confidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'open'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                     CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'open'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'routed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'suspended'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'closed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diff_amount_consistent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (diff_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ledger_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel_amount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recon_exception (channel_code, value_date, diff_type)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'closed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里的 <code>CHECK (diff_amount = ledger_amount - channel_amount)</code> 不是装饰：它把&quot;差值必须等于两侧之差&quot;这条不变量钉在数据库层，任何上游归一出错都会在写入时立刻暴露，而不是等到月末对账时才发现整批符号反了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在途差异-用观察窗代替工单\">在途差异：用观察窗代替工单</h2><h3 id=\"三个可度量特征\">三个可度量特征</h3><p>在途差异的本质是<strong>同一笔业务在两个系统里的记账时点不同</strong>。它有三个可度量的特征：金额完全相等（除分位尾差）、方向固定（通常是渠道比我方晚）、在有限窗口内必然消失。</p>\n<h3 id=\"观察窗长度如何标定\">观察窗长度如何标定</h3><p>处置策略不是&quot;建工单&quot;，而是&quot;进观察窗&quot;。窗口长度按渠道分别标定，不是全局常量：有的渠道 T+1 结算，有的 T+3，跨时区的还可能因为周末顺延到 T+4。设短了会把在途误判为真差异，设长了会延迟真差异的发现。</p>\n<p>窗口长度可以用分位数方法从历史数据里标定，而不是靠拍脑袋：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0.99</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>appear</mtext></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>disappear</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext>buffer</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{channel}} = Q_{0.99}\\left(\\{t_{\\text{appear}} \\to t_{\\text{disappear}}\\}\\right) + \\text{buffer}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.99</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">appear</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disappear</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即取该渠道历史上&quot;从出现到消失&quot;耗时的 99 分位，再加一个缓冲（通常 1 个自然日）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"到期升级的状态机\">到期升级的状态机</h3><p>观察窗是一个带到期时间的定时任务，到期时重新跑一次匹配：匹配上了就自动关单，匹配不上才转成短款/长款工单。在途差异不挂&quot;待查差异&quot;科目，否则账龄看板会被大量本会自愈的记录污染——这正是 <a href=\"../suspense-writeoff/aging-exception-cleanup\">账龄分析与积压清理</a> 要处理的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;observation_window&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;channel_code&quot;: &quot;CH_PAY_ALIPAY_HK&quot;,&#10;    &quot;window_days&quot;: 3,&#10;    &quot;persist_rule&quot;: &quot;never_post_to_suspense&quot;,&#10;    &quot;on_expire&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;recompute_match&quot;,&#10;      &quot;if_matched&quot;: &quot;auto_close_reason_in_transit&quot;,&#10;      &quot;if_unmatched&quot;: &quot;reclassify_and_route&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reclassify_as&quot;: [&quot;shortage&quot;, &quot;overage&quot;, &quot;unknown&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;durable_timer&quot;: &quot;scheduled_queue&quot;,&#10;    &quot;idempotency_key&quot;: &quot;batch_id + channel_code + exception_id&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"observation_window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"channel_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CH_PAY_ALIPAY_HK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"window_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"persist_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"never_post_to_suspense\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_expire\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recompute_match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"if_matched\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto_close_reason_in_transit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"if_unmatched\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reclassify_and_route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reclassify_as\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shortage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"overage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unknown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"durable_timer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scheduled_queue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"idempotency_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"batch_id + channel_code + exception_id\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"手续费差异-口径不一致才是主因\">手续费差异：口径不一致才是主因</h2><h3 id=\"四类口径分歧\">四类口径分歧</h3><p>手续费差异几乎从不是&quot;渠道多扣了钱&quot;，而是<strong>双方对手续费的记账口径不同</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径分歧</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>识别方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>费率版本不同步</td>\n<td>渠道调价后我方费率表未更新</td>\n<td>差异率在某个日期后阶跃上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯费率未对齐</td>\n<td>按月度累计交易额计费，我方按单笔计</td>\n<td>差异随月度累计额单调放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附加费未单独列示</td>\n<td>跨境费/货币转换费被渠道并入手续费</td>\n<td>差异 = 交易额的固定万分比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预扣与实扣时点不同</td>\n<td>渠道先预扣、结算时按实归还</td>\n<td>出现成对的反向差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"用差异率分布区分费率差与漏结算\">用差异率分布区分费率差与漏结算</h3><p>判断&quot;是不是手续费差异&quot;有一个高效的启发式：<strong>看差异率是否稳定</strong>。手续费差异的差异额通常与交易金额成固定比例（费率），所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>diff</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>amount</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{diff}/\\text{amount}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diff</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span></span></span></span></span> 会在一个窄区间内聚集；而漏结算造成的短款，其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>diff</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>amount</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{diff}/\\text{amount}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diff</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常等于 1（整笔未到）。用这个比例做一次直方图，两类差异几乎自动分开。</p>\n<p>需要强调的是，费率表的权威来源是渠道合同与渠道发布的费率文档，系统只能记录与比对，不能在系统内&quot;发明&quot;费率。当发现差异率阶跃时，正确动作是去核对渠道方的费率变更公告，这也是 <a href=\"../exception-governance/high-risk-channel-govern\">高发渠道治理</a> 中的典型整改项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汇率差异-折算时点比汇率本身更重要\">汇率差异：折算时点比汇率本身更重要</h2><h3 id=\"点差与折算时点两层来源\">点差与折算时点两层来源</h3><p>汇率差异的来源有两层，理解清楚才能正确核销。第一层是<strong>换汇点差（spread）</strong>：渠道给的换汇价不是中间价，而是在中间价上加了一个点差，这部分是渠道的正当收入，属于成本而非差错。第二层是<strong>折算时点</strong>：同一笔业务，我方按记账日汇率折算，渠道按清算日汇率折算，两天之间汇率波动就会产生差异。</p>\n<p>欧洲央行的欧元参考汇率就是典型的&quot;每日一个时点&quot;报价——它基于欧洲各央行的每日 concertation 程序（约 14:10 CET），每个工作日约 16:00 CET 发布，且明确声明仅供信息参考、不鼓励用于交易（<a href=\"https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html\">ECB 欧元参考汇率</a>）。这意味着如果你用一个&quot;每日一价&quot;的参考源去核对一个按&quot;实时价&quot;换汇的渠道，差异必然存在且无法消除。</p>\n<h3 id=\"币种精度与三档处置\">币种精度与三档处置</h3><p>工程上的处置分三档：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>只比&quot;折算后本币金额&quot;</strong>，不试图还原渠道使用的那一瞬汇率——你拿不到它，也不该拿。</li>\n<li><strong>汇率差异进容差核销</strong>，容差按币种与业务量标定（详见 <a href=\"exception-rule-threshold\">例外规则与容差阈值</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>区分真实损益与口径差异</strong>：按外币记账的应收应付在结算前会因汇率变动产生已实现/未实现损益（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foreign_exchange_risk\">Foreign exchange risk</a>），这类损益应进汇兑损益科目，而不是被当成&quot;待查差异&quot;反复建单。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个容易被忽视的硬约束：<strong>各币种的最小货币单位不同</strong>。ISO 4217 定义了每种货币的 minor unit——日元、韩元是 0 位小数，美元、欧元是 2 位，第纳尔类货币是 3 位，智利的 Unidad de Fomento 甚至是 4 位（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217\">ISO 4217</a>）。若系统内部统一用 2 位小数存储，日元金额在折算与拆分时必然产生 1 分级的伪差异。正确做法是内部以币种自己的最小单位（或更高的统一精度如 4 位）结算，只在展示层按 minor unit 舍入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分类的第一步是分方向（长款/短款），第二步才是分成因；方向决定账务地位，成因决定处置路径。</li>\n<li>在途差异不是差异，是时间差。用按渠道标定的观察窗自动消化，不要直接建工单。</li>\n<li>手续费差异的主因是记账口径不同步，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>diff</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>amount</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{diff}/\\text{amount}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diff</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分布就能把&quot;整笔未到&quot;和&quot;费率差&quot;分开。</li>\n<li>汇率差异来自点差与折算时点两层，后者无法消除，只能进容差；同时必须尊重 ISO 4217 的 minor unit，否则会系统性制造伪差异。</li>\n<li>把不变量（差值 = 两侧之差）写进数据库约束，让归一化错误在写入时就暴露。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分类完成后，下一步是让系统对&quot;该配给谁&quot;给出建议——见 <a href=\"exception-match-suggest\">差异自动匹配建议</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"长款/短款/在途/手续费/汇率差异","id":"长款-短款-在途-手续费-汇率差异"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：五类差异与它们的财务含义","id":"核心概念-五类差异与它们的财务含义"},{"level":2,"text":"长款与短款：方向决定处置路径","id":"长款与短款-方向决定处置路径"},{"level":3,"text":"以平台账本为基准的差值约定","id":"以平台账本为基准的差值约定"},{"level":3,"text":"归一化陷阱与不变量约束","id":"归一化陷阱与不变量约束"},{"level":2,"text":"在途差异：用观察窗代替工单","id":"在途差异-用观察窗代替工单"},{"level":3,"text":"三个可度量特征","id":"三个可度量特征"},{"level":3,"text":"观察窗长度如何标定","id":"观察窗长度如何标定"},{"level":3,"text":"到期升级的状态机","id":"到期升级的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"手续费差异：口径不一致才是主因","id":"手续费差异-口径不一致才是主因"},{"level":3,"text":"四类口径分歧","id":"四类口径分歧"},{"level":3,"text":"用差异率分布区分费率差与漏结算","id":"用差异率分布区分费率差与漏结算"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率差异：折算时点比汇率本身更重要","id":"汇率差异-折算时点比汇率本身更重要"},{"level":3,"text":"点差与折算时点两层来源","id":"点差与折算时点两层来源"},{"level":3,"text":"币种精度与三档处置","id":"币种精度与三档处置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"差异自动匹配建议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-classify-match/exception-match-suggest"}}